        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kim Ki-duk, Song Kang-ho\n- Films: Rough Cut, the 2017 film\n- Roles: director, assistant director\n- Events: 90th Academy Awards\n- Topics: South Korean entry for Best Foreign Language Film\n\nFacts:\n- Kim Ki-duk had a former assistant director who worked on the film \"Rough Cut.\"\n- That former assistant director later directed the 2017 film.\n- Song Kang-ho starred in the title role of the 2017 film.\n- The 2017 film was selected as the South Korean entry for the Best Foreign Language Film at the 90th Academy Awards.",
