        "original_id": "4c499d25-6902-5023-99e9-ce27375d0051",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jang Hoon, Kim Ki-duk, Juhn Jai-hong, Song Kang-ho, Thomas Kretschmann\n- Films: Rough Cut, Secret Reunion, The Front Line, A Taxi Driver, Beautiful, Poongsan\n- Roles: directors, assistant directors, actors, screenwriters\n\nFacts:\n- In 2008, Jang Hoon directed the film \"Rough Cut.\"\n- Kim Ki-duk gave the script for \"Rough Cut\" to his former assistant director Jang Hoon.\n- Kim Ki-duk gave scripts to his former assistant director Juhn Jai-hong for the films \"Beautiful\" and \"Poongsan.\"\n- In 2010, Jang Hoon directed the film \"Secret Reunion.\"\n- In 2011, Jang Hoon directed the film \"The Front Line.\"\n- In 2017, Jang Hoon directed the South Korean historical action drama film \"A Taxi Driver.\"\n- \"A Taxi Driver\" stars Song Kang-ho in the title role alongside Thomas Kretschmann.",
